+# Local reconciliation example
+
+## Gate 0
+
+Reconcile the selected existing intent against this repository and its engine
+record. No intake sweep is assigned. Commit the record locally on the isolated
+working branch; no push or PR is requested. Queue counts without a snapshot
+remain UNMEASURED. This policy does not grant capture mutation or external
+publication authority. The stage reviewer and engine approval rules still apply.
